<h1>🔷 Crystal Systems</h1>
<p class="lead">Every crystal's atoms repeat in a lattice that falls into one of seven crystal systems (plus amorphous materials with no lattice).</p>
<div class="browse-grid systems-browse">
{% for s in site.systems %}
  <a class="tile t{{ loop.index % 4 + 1 }} system-tile" href="{{ s.url }}">
    <div class="lattice mini grow-{{ s.key }}" aria-hidden="true"><span class="lat-cell"></span><span class="lat-cell"></span></div>
    <strong>{{ s.title }}</strong>
    <span>{{ s.items.length | number }} minerals · {{ s.axes.label }}</span>
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
